---LINES
ok	= gh - - - - "[ ok ]"
err	= gv - - - - "[ exit= 1 ]"





---SCREEN
=command run & exit code indicator

  when command completed, You get indicator in one of form:
  .ok...       -- on success
  .err........ -- if command terminates with error or on a signal

  Pass codes are:
    .:SP... or .:CA...
	return to main menu
    .:HE... get this page then returns to main menu
    .:AU... .:AD... .:AR...
	return to command editor 
    .:AL...
	return to command editor with cursor position restored
    other printable keys:
	type another command from scratch
  
  Warning about defencive trap:
    .:NL... and other control codes discarded preventing unexpected action
  
---END
